"vercel"}]}, "id": "2122812237169426606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 12609, "like_count": 163, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "OpenAI just put out the most cybersecurity-capable models in the world. Excellent timing.\n\nImportant signal: @vercel DeepsecBench is a stealth cyber benchmark. No lab has had access to the codebases to train on.\n\nhttps://t.co/14WK4F7irU https://t.co/TXMgZ8URsA", "url": "https://x.com/rauchg/status/2122812237169426606"}, {"author_id": "166138615", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:51:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122809964649459861"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 298, "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/Zjezw5zdRb"}]}, "id": "2122809964649459861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 5740, "like_count": 65, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 36, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122754439886905593", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Agent swarms are the next scaling frontier for AI.\n\nFor years, we’ve scaled intelligence by training larger models and giving them more time to think. But there’s another dimension: running many agents in parallel, exploring different approaches, challenging each other, and https://t.co/Zjezw5zdRb", "url": "https://x.com/amasad/status/2122809964649459861"}, {"author_id": "166138615", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:35:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122805977187549558"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 90, "start": 67, "url": "https://t.co/PEnljUKPQI"}]}, "id": "2122805977187549558", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 10597, "like_count": 91, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122804602143924397", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Didn’t think it was possible to do iOS-quality gestures on the web https://t.co/PEnljUKPQI", "url": "https://x.com/amasad/status/2122805977187549558"}, {"author_id": "166138615", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:11:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122784726671134764"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 122, "start": 99, "url": "https://t.co/lDuF4A80r0"}]}, "id": "2122784726671134764", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 211, "impression_count": 45545, "like_count": 326, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 49, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122759176288190724", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Replit Missions can spin up a swarm of agents to replicate any type of software of any complexity. https://t.co/lDuF4A80r0", "url": "https://x.com/amasad/status/2122784726671134764"}, {"author_id": "15540222", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:19:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122771609261879478"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 66, "id": "2072364740135841792", "start": 62, "username": "eve"}], "urls": [{"end": 300, "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/ftOkcm00gJ"}]}, "id": "2122771609261879478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 284, "impression_count": 36388, "like_count": 446, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 22}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122758127968027108", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Own your intelligence with https://t.co/L9YIua3a2H, now 1.0.\n\n@eve is the first technology that makes building and deploying a production agent, as easy as using an agent.\n\nAt 2.4 million downloads a week, eve has done in 142 days what took Next.js 5 years… eve of a new era 😊 https://t.co/ftOkcm00gJ", "url": "https://x.com/rauchg/status/2122771609261879478"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122754015175864320"]}, "author_id": "166138615", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:11:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122754439886905593"], "id": "2122754439886905593", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 361, "impression_count": 78087, "like_count": 639, "quote_count": 40, "reply_count": 97, "retweet_count": 71}, "text": "LLMs have gotten more autonomous recently but when you give them a goal they often misunderstand you, work aimlessly, and waste your tokens.\n\nToday, we’re introducing Missions—the world’s first agentic swarm harness that can accomplish any goal you give them within set budget. https://t.co/IBx3kn1Jhx", "url": "https://x.com/amasad/status/2122754439886905593"}, {"author_id": "15540222", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:40:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122746777376006400"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "1467726470533754880", "start": 19, "username": "nextjs"}]}, "id": "2122746777376006400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 168, "impression_count": 45792, "like_count": 723, "quote_count": 17, "reply_count": 123, "retweet_count": 28}, "text": "My first commit to @nextjs was a spec. At the time I called it README-driven development.\n\nBefore you w̶r̶i̶t̶e̶ generate code, define what you want. \n\nPrompt, spec, exit criteria, desired outcomes. The autonomy loop.\nhttps://t.co/u28pVc68Fp", "url": "https://x.com/rauchg/status/2122746777376006400"}, {"author_id": "15540222", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:53:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122734970280288481"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 25, "start": 2, "url": "https://t.co/v7HnCbeA1c"}]}, "id": "2122734970280288481", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 43597, "like_count": 798, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122726005219737649", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🖤 https://t.co/v7HnCbeA1c", "url": "https://x.com/rauchg/status/2122734970280288481"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122670159844577280"]}, "author_id": "79957442", "created_at": "2026-11-17T12:36:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122670161916506197"], "id": "2122670161916506197", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 35221, "like_count": 611, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 44, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "my wife is the coolest person i know.\n\nshe also happens to be a founder.\npassionate, loving, ridiculously talented.\nabsolute rockstar. https://t.co/JxuvPHi6Dz", "url": "https://x.com/antonosika/status/2122670161916506197"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 1588, "media_key": "3_2122846196880322560", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXXdXmXXMAAMsn8.jpg", "width": 1714}, {"height": 747, "media_key": "3_2122811365928714240", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXW9sK9XwAA5j-K.png", "width": 1328}, {"duration_ms": 124165, "height": 2160, "media_key": "13_2122754015175864320", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122754015175864320/img/o7NyMobzap6waQHK.jpg", "type": "video", "variants": [{"bit_rate": 10368000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122754015175864320/vid/avc1/1920x1080/-5-2cy_06BseLNp4.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 256000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122754015175864320/vid/avc1/480x270/EvDV8HHsFuNuXbzY.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 25128000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122754015175864320/vid/avc1/3840x2160/oq3OPDpsDQCSxGt8.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 832000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122754015175864320/vid/avc1/640x360/_sdVR0lAdd4DQAi1.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 2176000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122754015175864320/vid/avc1/1280x720/WSfjxWNMwiGQrU_l.mp4"}, {"content_type": "application/x-mpegURL", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122754015175864320/pl/Ff8ga_Iz3IxbHFG1.m3u8"}], "width": 3840}, {"height": 768, "media_key": "3_2122670159844577280", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXU9Q5TbkAAByll.jpg", "width": 1024}], "tweets": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122816667902177280"]}, "author_id": "152108221", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:18:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122816672625275030"], "id": "2122816672625275030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 579, "impression_count": 22649, "like_count": 425, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "New skill: modern-web-guidance\n\nYour agent looks up Chrome's Modern Web Guidance, applies it to your code, then checks the result in a real browser\n\nLayout shift, reduced motion, dark mode, dialog focus, more\n\nStart here:\nnpx skills add vercel-labs/agent-browser https://t.co/SObV8fLNzh"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122810971307786240"]}, "author_id": "19888273", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:55:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122810974579425680"], "id": "2122810974579425680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 9164, "like_count": 84, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Agent swarms are the next scaling law in AI. We scaled pretraining, then reasoning. Now we scale the number of agents working together.\n\nOn 13 NumPy optimization tasks, 1 agent hit up to 4x speedups, 16 agents reached 17x, and 32 agents reached 19x.\n\nToday we're launching Replit https://t.co/o0L4svRA5N"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122754015175864320"]}, "author_id": "166138615", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:11:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122754439886905593"], "id": "2122754439886905593", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 361, "impression_count": 78087, "like_count": 639, "quote_count": 40, "reply_count": 97, "retweet_count": 71}, "text": "LLMs have gotten more autonomous recently but when you give them a goal they often misunderstand you, work aimlessly, and waste your tokens.\n\nToday, we’re introducing Missions—the world’s first agentic swarm harness that can accomplish any goal you give them within set budget. https://t.co/IBx3kn1Jhx"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122803993219088384"]}, "author_id": "1463467434", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:30:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122804602143924397"], "id": "2122804602143924397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 42, "impression_count": 14193, "like_count": 72, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Just used Replit Missions to take my mobile web-application skills to the next level. Literally tearing down decade old barriers that prevented us from having high quality interactions on the web. Interactions previously exclusive only to native apps. Now unleashed. This is web! https://t.co/5Anz7y1u7C"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122758542809526273"]}, "author_id": "366289783", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122759176288190724"], "id": "2122759176288190724", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 221, "impression_count": 61555, "like_count": 198, "quote_count": 17, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 25}, "text": "The leading observability platform wants $83,700/yr just to monitor your app and catch issues.\n\nSo Replit Missions built DataCat: https://t.co/u3AmCbhzff\n\n100% free.\n\nThis isn't a prototype. Agent swarms explored thousands of workflows in the leading observability platform and https://t.co/ECMa8WLdwu"}, {"author_id": "4686835494", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:25:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122758127968027108"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 69, "start": 46, "url": "https://t.co/UJy14cC8mt"}]}, "id": "2122758127968027108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 477, "impression_count": 80471, "like_count": 702, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 37}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122757457101681075", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Introducing eve 1.0\n\nBuild production agents. https://t.co/UJy14cC8mt"}, {"author_id": "2070631956824698880", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:18:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122726005219737649"], "id": "2122726005219737649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 63893, "impression_count": 33632132, "like_count": 877129, "quote_count": 20492, "reply_count": 45750, "retweet_count": 96776}, "text": "Over the past week, I’ve been overwhelmed by the love and support of friends, industry colleagues, and people I've never met. Thank you to everyone who has shown kindness to my family and me. It means the world to me.\n\nI came to the United States 53 years ago, and becoming an"}], "users": [{"id": "15540222", "name": "Guillermo Rauch", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1783856060249595904/8TfcCN0r_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 920242, "following_count": 662, "like_count": 75421, "listed_count": 5108, "media_count": 4981, "tweet_count": 53792}, "username": "rauchg", "verified": false}, {"id": "166138615", "name": "Amjad Masad", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1897858917507776512/TRVTyKFk_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 507381, "following_count": 1584, "like_count": 55827, "listed_count": 4370, "media_count": 3590, "tweet_count": 30315}, "username": "amasad", "verified": false}, {"id": "4686835494", "name": "Vercel", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1767351110228918272/3Pndc5OT_normal.png", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 474944, "following_count": 10, "like_count": 1357, "listed_count": 3542, "media_count": 336, "tweet_count": 1984}, "username": "vercel", "verified": true}, {"id": "2072364740135841792", "name": "eve", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2072372845049516033/6_3GQF2j_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 14184, "following_count": 12, "like_count": 190, "listed_count": 72, "media_count": 35, "tweet_count": 216}, "username": "eve", "verified": true}, {"id": "1467726470533754880", "name": "Next.js", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1565710214019444737/if82cpbS_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 298526, "following_count": 15, "like_count": 214, "listed_count": 1593, "media_count": 105, "tweet_count": 399}, "username": "nextjs", "verified": true}, {"id": "79957442", "name": "Anton Osika", "profile_image_url